  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">King&#x2019;s Baton Relay &#x2013; Commonwealth Games Clean Ocean Holiday Programme Campaign</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the project is to use sport as a platform to engage children, youth and communities across Tongatapu in environmental awareness and action, with specific attention paid to reducing plastic pollution and protecting Tonga&#x2019;s oceans, while also celebrating the arrival of The King&#x2019;s Baton Relay ahead of the Commonwealth Games 2026.</narrative>
  </description>
